# Testing Tiers (fast by default, E2E when it matters)

**Do not run full Maestro tours or `verify:real-e2e` on every small change.** Family Values ran too much full E2E during incremental commits — avoid that.

## Tier guide

| Tier | When | Command | ~Time |
|------|------|---------|-------|
| **0 quick** | Every commit; docs-only; tiny predictable fix | `bash scripts/verify-tier.sh quick` | 2–5 min |
| **1 area** | Normal code change — test **affected surface only** | `SCOPE=ui bash scripts/verify-tier.sh area` | 3–8 min |
| **2 goal** | Multi-file goal **finished** (e.g. tray parity done) | `bash scripts/verify-tier.sh goal` | 8–15 min |
| **3 stitch** | Goal + device UI proof (Metro + emulator) | `SCOPE=tray bash scripts/verify-tier.sh stitch` | 15–25 min |
| **4 full** | Milestone / pre-TestFlight / pre-ship only | `bash scripts/verify-tier.sh full` | 30–60 min |

## SCOPE values (tier 1 / 3)

| SCOPE | Use when you changed |
|-------|----------------------|
| `ui` / `tray` / `family-values` | `@shc/ui`, trays, morph, tabs, web SHCTrayWeb |
| `web` / `pwa` | `apps/web`, PWA routes, Next build |
| `api` / `medusa` / `backend` | Medusa routes, modules, workflows |
| `mobile` / `expo` | Native/Metro/EAS, bundle size |
| `contracts` | `@shc/types`, `@shc/business-rules` |
| `checkout` / `listings` | Single Maestro flow for that flow |

## Skip rules (allowed)

- **Blueprint-only** or comment/copy: no tests required
- **Single-line fix** you are confident about: tier 0 quick OR skip if typecheck already green
- **Mid-goal WIP commits**: tier 0 or tier 1 with matching SCOPE only — **not** tier 2–4

## Required gates

| Event | Minimum tier |
|-------|----------------|
| Normal PR / commit | **0** or **1** with SCOPE |
| Goal declared done | **2** (`verify:real-e2e`) |
| UI flow goal (trays, checkout, listings) | **3** with matching SCOPE |
| Phase stitch / TestFlight / Railway ship | **4** |

## What NOT to run during incremental work

- `bash scripts/run-maestro-full-tour.sh` — only tier 4
- `pnpm verify:real-e2e` — only tier 2+ (creates real orders on Railway)
- `family-values-audit.sh` / `family-values-evidence.sh` with `MAESTRO_RUN_DEVICE=true` — only at goal close

## CI alignment

- Every push: `build-test-typecheck` + guards (fast)
- `medusa-real-e2e`: `integrate/*` branches + manual dispatch only — not every `main` push
- Maestro device runs: optional (`MAESTRO_RUN_DEVICE`), validate YAML only by default